| :--- | :--- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| Torgersen | (Intercept) | 0.853 | 1.013 | 1.022 | 0.005 | -1.153 | 2.954 |
| Biscoe | (Intercept) | -1.605 | 1.013 | 1.024 | 0.003 | -3.679 | 0.426 |
